    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19204" root="سخط" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُخْطٌ</span></b> , (S, Msb, K,) a subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَخِطَ</span>, (Msb,)
<i>Dislike, displeasure, disapprobation,</i> or <i>discontent;</i> (TA;) <i>contr. of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِضًى</span>; (S, K, TA;) as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُخُطٌ</span></b>  (Sgh, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَخَطٌ</span></b>  (S, K) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْخَطٌ</span></b> : (Sgh, K:) [the last two of which are
inf. ns.:] <i>anger;</i> (Msb;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَخَطٌ</span></b> . (TA.)

